@startuml
title RoomBook - see availability and book a room

|Staff|
start
:Open RoomBook;
|System|
:Show today's rooms with current status;
|Staff|
if (A free room is wanted?) then (yes)
  :Pick a room and a time slot;
  |System|
  if (Slot overlaps an existing booking?) then (yes)
    :Refuse and name the conflicting booking;
    |Staff|
    :Pick a different slot;
    detach
  else (no)
    :Create the booking;
    :Confirm and show it on today's view;
  endif
else (no)
  |System|
  :Stay on today's view;
endif
stop
@enduml
